General Thematics makes home appliances and other consumer goods, a competitor to [[Org/Concordia/index|Concordia]]. [[Org/Belvedere/index|Belvedere]] keeps a large partnership with the company as a way to keep Concordia appliances out of its laboratories. Along with [[Org/Hildebrandt Corporation/index|Hildebrandt]], General Thematics is pulling back from its contracts with Belvedere and the [[People/Qureshi|Qureshi]] family, saying it means to focus elsewhere without saying where.
